   "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/stream-low-latency-speech-from-ai-agents-using-kokoro-tts-on-amazon-sagemaker-ai/",
   "canonical_url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/stream-low-latency-speech-from-ai-agents-using-kokoro-tts-on-amazon-sagemaker-ai",
   "title": "Stream low-latency speech from AI agents using Kokoro TTS on Amazon SageMaker AI",
   "snippet": "Voice agents often wait for an agent's full response before starting speech synthesis, adding latency users feel directly. This post shows how to stream each sentence to a Kokoro-82M text-to-speech model on Amazon SageMaker AI as the agent produces it, and how to get that audio back to a browser over Server-Sent Events or a unified binary transport.",
